<!--
Bulgarian translation. Tone is informal "ти"-form throughout ("Облечи …",
"Вземи …"). Scope: full UI coverage — insight-prose templates, garment labels,
clothes-rule editor, outfit-card labels, region/voice-locale picker names,
settings, onboarding, notifications, and all other UI surfaces.

What is NOT overridden, by design:
- `app_name` — brand identifier, identical across locales.
- `insight_time_am` / `_pm` / `_midnight` / `_noon` (and the *_minutes
  variants) — English-only spoken-time formatter helpers. Bulgarian uses
  `insight_time_hour` / `insight_time_hour_minutes` which are translated
  below; preposition "в" comes from surrounding templates. The AM/PM keys
  exist for `Locale.language == "en"` paths only and would never be read
  in a Bulgarian runtime.
-->
